  "reference": "Isaya 43",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "43",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 43"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "43",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento kawono Yehova m’ucwii wacu kumae, E Yakobo, man ng’atu m’ung’ini, E Israel: Lworo kud unegi, kum aweri; alwong’i ku nyingi, in i para. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinde m’ikadhu kud i pi, wabibedo wakudi; man kud i kulo ma dit, gibimwonyi ngo: kinde m’iwotho kud i mac, ibiwang’ ungo, kadok lebmac de biliel i kumi ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum an a Yehova Mungu peri, Ng’atu Maleng’ mir Israel, Jalarni; amio Misiri calu jambwar peri, man Ethiopia ku Seba kakeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum in i gin ma pire tek i wang’a, man mi yung, man ameri; ka kumeno abimio dhanu kakeri, man kodhidhanu ka kwo peri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lworo kud unegi; kum wanuti wakudi: abigamu kodhini ku yo nyangu, man abicoki ku yo reto; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abiwacu ni yor ariwa ma malu kumae, Wodhi; man ni yor ariwa ma piny kumae, Kud icer; kel wota ku bor, man nyiga kud i kajik mi ng’om; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku ba dhanu ceke m’ulwongre ku nyinga, man m’acwio pi dwong’ para, m’ang’ino, eyo, m’atimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuwodh ju m’abinga ma wang’gi nuti, ku ju m’udhing’ ma ithgi nuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wek thek ceke cokre karacelo, man wek kodhidhanu cokri karacelo: ng’a m’i kindgi ma copo yero lembe maeni, man ma copo nyutho iwa gin ma kwong’a wek gikel jumulembe migi, kara jugony lembe m’i wigi; kadi wek giwinji, man giwac kumae, En e andha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wun wu jumulembe para, Yehova wacu, man jatic para m’agoyo wie; kara wung’ei man wuyia, man wung’ei nia an a en: Mungu moko mbe ma jular jucwio ira, kadi ma bibedo nuti yo ng’eya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An, ndhu an, an a Yehova; man jalar moko mbe m’umeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayero, man abodho, man anyutho; e mungu ma jawirok moko mbe i kindwu: ka kumeno wun wu jumulembe para, Yehova wacu, man an a Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyo, ugambre ma ceng’ nuti an a en; man ng’atu moko mbe ma copo bodho kud i cinga: abitimo tic, e ng’a ma copo cero maeni?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova, ma Jawar mu, Ng’atu Maleng’ mir Israel, uwacu kumae: Aoro kwenda i Babeli piwu, man abikelogi ceke piny calu jung’wec, en e Jukaldayo, i combo mir anyong’a migi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An a Yehova, ma Ng’atu Maleng’ mu, ma Jacwic mir Israel, m’Ubimo mu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova, m’utimo yor i nam, man yor i pi ma dit; uwacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "en e ng’atu m’uwodho magali ku riuni, man njuru asikari ku ng’atu ma jarukara (givuto piny karacelo, gibiai ungo; gimbe, junegogi calu bonguthala): ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kud wupoi pi gin ma kwong’a, kadok pi gin ma con de kud wupidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, abitimo gin ma nyen; kawono ebiloth; wubing’eye ngo? abitimo yo cil i yamba, man kulo ma dit i ng’omngele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yedi m’i thim biyunga, utho ku udo kum amio pi i yamba, man kulo ma dit i ng’omngele kara ami giramadha ni dhanu para, gi ju m’agoyo wigi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dhanu m’ang’ino pira gira, kara ginyuth pak para.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ilwong’a ngo, E Yakobo; ento iol ni kuma, E Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikelo ira kum rombe peri ngo ni lam m’awang’a; kadi ayunga de iyunga ngo ku lam peri. Anuri ngo ku lam mi mogo, kadi aoli de ngo kud udok ma ng’wice ng’ar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ing’iewo ira thiang’ ungo ku sente, kadi iyeng’a de ngo ku mo mi lam peri; ento inura ku dubo peri, iola ku kier peri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An, en e an, an a ng’atu m’uyweyo gondri peri woko pira gira; e abipoi kum dubo peri ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Poya; wek wapor lembe karacelo: wodh lembe peri, kara jugony lembe m’i wii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaru ma kwong’a dubo, man juponji peri gidubo ira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno abicido judongomawijo mi kamaleng’; man abidwoko Yakobo ni kwong’, man Israel ni cac.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
